<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-10-11T12:24:57.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:24:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi missiles struck Riyadh airport, killing twelve and wounding hundreds, prompting Saudi vows of a decisive response and U.S. forces disabling a cargo vessel attempting to breach an Iran‑imposed blockade in the Gulf of Oman. Iran warned of an environmental disaster and signaled a shift in its nuclear doctrine, while the IRGC responded to a supertanker mine strike, extending combat into Iranian waters. The conflict now includes direct maritime confrontations alongside the proxy war in Saudi airspace and the Gulf of Oman. 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/10/yemen-government-allied-forces-recapture-bab-al-mandab-strait-houthis-taiz&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/10/yemeni-governments-military-says-its-forces-advancing-against-houthis?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/b373cf00-9a94-4dc7-bdda-bc7006da1148?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/08/us-aircraft-carrier-abraham-lincoln-returns-to-san-diego-after-record-deployment&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPQW45WExhT3hnUXQ5UHZfYnFwOEFMbEZZZFcxQ0p4VUowUFBXZ3NDX2NFcGZUTTNHQmpDUGxqcEZ3UmJ1YWdCQTFiOGVQOUF4X3hGQlByNnRPdDBZR29RYzhrSzBac2JXQlA0bVZnaHJ2bjRQZzRIS1Y3WjBnb2dpR1VpUlVucmwzaVpwZko2MGxPb0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9NNm8zRGJqcUNiY05QN1Y0MHN1QnJVV0IzNTl2OHY2T3NEdlVkanBTUWFlVEprZVZrLXNvbVFtMWxxeXRreFZmRDFRY0lUbWdtcENxXzBMMm9LNm8?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;h